This design pattern will treat single object and group of object as same
Real example:
lets say we want to perform below operation 
getSize()
print()
on File and Folder

if(file) 
  ....
else
  ....

The above programming is bad 
Here Composite design pattern is useful

               Composite
                  |
    ------------------------
    |                      |
   Leaf                Composite   
                           |
                        Children